# Orrin's Sledge Camp (CIPlay orrins_sledge_camp): the barn (the bears come), Orrin's note 1, two polar bears, the sledge
# shed, Orrin's hut (note 2), the cook hut (note 3), the lookout, the zipline crate, Orrin's note 4.
island Orrin's Sledge Camp
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by -9.2 -23; the points below are in the old frame
offset 9.2 23
expect step 0
expect title The Sledge Camp
expect animals Goat 3
zone barn
expect step 1
read Orrin's note 1
expect step 2
kill Polar bear
expect step 3
# REDO 10-24: the shed's chest waits for the sledge winch
expect hidden sledgeshed
open Hay chest
open Orrin's chest
wait 3
expect step 4
read Orrin's note 2
open Camp stores
expect item Bucket 1
read Orrin's note 3
zone lookout
open Lookout box
wait 3
expect step 5
expect hidden ziplinecrate
use pinevines
expect shown ziplinecrate
open Zipline crate
wait 3
expect story harness 3
expect step 7
use sledgewinch
expect story harness 0
expect shown sledgeshed
expect step 8
open Sledge shed
wait 3
expect done
read Orrin's note 4
